.git

# Real secrets (DATABASE_URL, JWT secrets, encryption keys, SMTP password,
# etc.) — never let these enter the build context. Docker builds these
# Dockerfiles' `build` stage with a broad `COPY <workspace> ./<workspace>`,
# which would otherwise bake a locally-present .env straight into that
# stage's image layer even though the final runtime stage never uses it.
.env
**/.env
.env.*
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
